---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us — tiwantiwa" 
  description="About tiwantiwa, the premier digital magazine chronicling Nigeria, the diaspora, business, technology, and culture."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        About tiwantiwa
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-serif italic">
        Chronicling the ingenuity, enterprise, and culture of Nigeria and its global diaspora.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-amber max-w-none font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 space-y-6">
      <p>
        <strong>tiwantiwa.com</strong> is an independent, enterprise-grade digital publication designed for the modern era. Operating at the intersection of rigorous journalism and cutting-edge autonomous publishing infrastructure, we examine the forces shaping the Nigerian ecosystem at home and across borders.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Editorial Mandate</h2>
      <p>
        From the bustling tech hubs of Yaba to the vibrant cultural capitals of the global diaspora, our coverage spans eight core sections: <strong>Nigeria News & Policy</strong>, <strong>Diaspora Stories</strong>, <strong>Business & Money</strong>, <strong>Technology & AI</strong>, <strong>Culture & Entertainment</strong>, <strong>Lifestyle & Living</strong>, <strong>People & Profiles</strong>, and <strong>Ideas & Opinions</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>Zero-Cost Autonomous Infrastructure</h2>
      <p>
        Built with high-performance static architecture, tiwantiwa operates with absolute zero ongoing software overhead. Powered by intelligent content pipelines and human editorial governance, we maintain the highest standards of accuracy, depth, and independence.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 font-semibold transition-colors">
        &larr; Back to Feed
      </a>
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 font-sans">
        Established 2026
      </span>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
